  },
  "units": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "周五下午，客户会议室的投影停在第十七页。",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.615,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 1,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_001.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "客户项目负责人指着屏幕问赵梦琪：",
      "start": 3.615,
      "end": 6.495,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 2,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_001.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "“这组增长率，为什么和我们昨天确认的不一样？”",
      "start": 6.495,
      "end": 10.158,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 2,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_001.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "赵梦琪盯了两秒，胃一下沉了下去。",
      "start": 10.158,
      "end": 12.885,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 3,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_001.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "那是A项目的数据，却被她放进了B项目的PPT。",
      "start": 12.885,
      "end": 16.392,
      "pauseAfter": 0.45,
      "sentence": 4,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_001.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "二十七岁的赵梦琪，是咨询公司连续两年的最高绩效顾问。",
      "start": 16.842,
      "end": 21.056,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 5,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_002.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "她反应快、交付稳，却几乎没人见过她拒绝请求。",
      "start": 21.056,
      "end": 25.505,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 6,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_002.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "她担心一句“不”，会留下难合作、难相处的评价。",
      "start": 25.505,
      "end": 29.274,
      "pauseAfter": 0.45,
      "sentence": 7,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_002.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "这个季度，她同时服务三个客户。",
      "start": 29.724,
      "end": 32.107,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 8,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_003.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "周一的资源会上，合伙人Patrick Liu问她能不能再接一段市场分析，",
      "start": 32.107,
      "end": 36.667,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 9,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_003.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "她说可以。",
      "start": 36.667,
      "end": 37.938,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 9,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_003.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "周三深夜，Patrick发消息问一份模型能否提前，",
      "start": 37.938,
      "end": 41.377,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 10,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_003.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "她回复没问题。",
      "start": 41.377,
      "end": 43.053,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 10,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_003.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "凌晨两点，她还在三个项目的文件夹之间来回切换。",
      "start": 43.053,
      "end": 46.428,
      "pauseAfter": 0.45,
      "sentence": 11,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_003.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "她以为，多答应一次，就能多守住一段关系。",
      "start": 46.878,
      "end": 51.429,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 12,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_004.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "可到了周五，三个项目的表格、版本和截止时间挤在一起。",
      "start": 51.429,
      "end": 56.437,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 13,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_004.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "她把错误的数据带进了客户会议室。",
      "start": 56.437,
      "end": 58.782,
      "pauseAfter": 0.45,
      "sentence": 14,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_004.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "汇报提前结束后，Patrick没有在走廊里追问。",
      "start": 59.232,
      "end": 62.847,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 15,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_005.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "他带赵梦琪回到办公室，关上门，",
      "start": 62.847,
      "end": 65.353,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 16,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_005.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "只问了一句：“梦琪，你最后一次拒绝别人的请求，",
      "start": 65.353,
      "end": 70.063,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 16,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_005.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "是什么时候？”",
      "start": 70.063,
      "end": 71.04,
      "pauseAfter": 0.45,
      "sentence": 16,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_005.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "赵梦琪张了张嘴。",
      "start": 71.49,
      "end": 73.162,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 17,
      "paragraph": 6,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_006.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "她想到昨晚的消息、周三的模型、月初临时接下的访谈记录。",
      "start": 73.162,
      "end": 78.359,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 18,
      "paragraph": 6,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_006.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "三分钟过去，她依然找不到答案。",
      "start": 78.359,
      "end": 80.946,
      "pauseAfter": 0.45,
      "sentence": 19,
      "paragraph": 6,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_006.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Patrick把她的项目排期放到桌上：",
      "start": 81.396,
      "end": 83.741,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 20,
      "paragraph": 7,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_007.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "“你每次都说可以，我就无法知道哪一次已经超过你的承受范围。",
      "start": 83.741,
      "end": 88.04,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 20,
      "paragraph": 7,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_007.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "边界不说出来，风险就会在交付里替你说。”",
      "start": 88.04,
      "end": 91.26,
      "pauseAfter": 0.45,
      "sentence": 21,
      "paragraph": 7,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_007.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "那个周末，赵梦琪把所有承诺列成一张表。",
      "start": 91.71,
      "end": 94.99,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 22,
      "paragraph": 8,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_008.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "她第一次看清，自己维护的并不只是客户进度，",
      "start": 94.99,
      "end": 98.28,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 23,
      "paragraph": 8,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_008.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "还有一种更隐蔽的安全感：",
      "start": 98.28,
      "end": 100.41,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 23,
      "paragraph": 8,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_008.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "只要不让任何人失望，她就不会失去信任。",
      "start": 100.41,
      "end": 103.302,
      "pauseAfter": 0.45,
      "sentence": 23,
      "paragraph": 8,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_008.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "下周一的资源排期会上，Patrick提到第四个项目。",
      "start": 103.752,
      "end": 107.78,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 24,
      "paragraph": 9,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_009.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "赵梦琪停了一秒，说：“我可以保证现在两个核心项目的质量。",
      "start": 107.78,
      "end": 112.938,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 25,
      "paragraph": 9,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_009.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "第四个项目需要延期，或者增加一名顾问。”",
      "start": 112.938,
      "end": 115.752,
      "pauseAfter": 0.45,
      "sentence": 26,
      "paragraph": 9,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_009.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "会议室安静了两秒。",
      "start": 116.202,
      "end": 117.987,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 27,
      "paragraph": 10,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_010.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Patrick点头，让项目延期一周，并补了一名顾问。",
      "start": 117.987,
      "end": 122.398,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 28,
      "paragraph": 10,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_010.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "赵梦琪没有失去信任。",
      "start": 122.398,
      "end": 124.116,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 29,
      "paragraph": 10,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_010.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "她第一次让别人准确看见了自己的容量。",
      "start": 124.116,
      "end": 126.738,
      "pauseAfter": 0.45,
      "sentence": 30,
      "paragraph": 10,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_010.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "压力会把“照料与结盟”推向过度承诺；",
      "start": 127.188,
      "end": 129.944,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 31,
      "paragraph": 11,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_011.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "真正可靠的关系，经得起一句清楚的“不”。",
      "start": 129.944,
      "end": 133.164,
      "pauseAfter": 0.45,
      "sentence": 32,
      "paragraph": 11,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_011.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "收藏这条。",
      "start": 133.614,
      "end": 134.576,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 33,
      "paragraph": 12,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_012.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "下次你又想把所有请求都接下来时，",
      "start": 134.576,
      "end": 137.492,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 34,
      "paragraph": 12,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_012.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "先问自己：这是真正的负责，",
      "start": 137.492,
      "end": 139.885,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 34,
      "paragraph": 12,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_012.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "还是害怕让别人失望？",
      "start": 139.885,
      "end": 141.726,
      "pauseAfter": 0.0,
      "sentence": 34,
      "paragraph": 12,
      "voice": "zh-CN-Xiaochen:DragonHDLatestNeural",
      "voiceGender": "female",
      "sentenceAudio": "audio/tts_paragraphs/paragraph_012.wav"
    }
  ]
}
